(text "Optional BIOS NOR flash, NOT FITTED by default. S29AL016J (2 MB) in byte mode: BYTE#\nlow, PIO A0 on DQ15/A-1, PIO A1-A20 on flash A0-A19, so flash byte address = PIO byte\naddress and the unlock cycles land at BIOS offsets 0xAAA/0x555. /CE = /CS2, /OE =\n/RD, /WE = /WR0, D0-D7 shared with the FX3. No flash signal goes to the FX3 (GPIO39\nonly senses /CS2). The full 2 MB needs the BIOS window (1F801010) enlarged to 21\naddress bits. Fit only with the Switch Board /CS2 mod: on a stock console pin 39 is\nGND, which would enable the flash on every /RD. RESET# follows the console reset; WP#\nhigh; RY/BY# unused (firmware polls DQ7/DQ6)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f6627e5f-99b4-40f9-826f-326914196131"))
